<text><![CDATA[Uranus is the seventh planet from the Sun.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Uranus was discovered in 1781 by William Herschel; a European astronomer.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Uranus is the only planet that rotates on its axis sideways.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Uranus has the coldest surface temperature among all the planets of the solar system.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of day:</B><br>17 hours, 8 minutes]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of year:</B> 84 Earth years]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Diameter:</B> 51,200 km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Surface temperature:</B> -220&#176;C]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Earth:</B> 2.57 billion km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Sun:</B> 2.875 billion km]]></text>



